<p>Now that you've learned some theory about JavaScript and what you can do=
 with it, we'll walk you through a practical tutorial so you can see how to=
 create a simple JavaScript program. Here you'll build a simple "Guess the =
number" game, step by step.</p>
<figure class=3D"table-container"><table>
